<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>efficient taming , this script was fine tuned specifically for taming in a populated area with full buffs from hidden village and lvl 5 spell potion (casting speed reduced by 54%) it assumes a kill speed of more or less a second (i use it to tame rare soul pets in crystal valley and i'm able to kill those pretty quick)  on buttone number 1 u add taming and on 2 your method of attack (you can use lune chips obviously but will would have to add another action if u wish to make pets attack)

i used this one to get a pet to s4 and it works just as i wanted it to that being said u may need to change numbers a bit to get it working as effeciently</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download | Скачать бесплатные макросы </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 30 1
Delay 3750 ms
//the long delay makes it so it keeps pressing tame to ensure it gets it done
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 64 ms
KeyDown 31 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 31 1
Delay 18750 ms
//this is the time frame for the cooldown it depends on your kill speed and is the reason why u want populated areas
GoWhile 1 999999</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>rappelz/taming</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>